        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">56</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The hopper croaks loudly, after which it starts to shake uncontrollably. Blood starts to pour out of its eyes and soon enough, the hopper drops down to the ground. Slight muscle twitches are all that remains. The hopper is dead.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
