        <source>::You open up this precious vial and move it closer to the hopper. As if the hopper knew, it leaps towards your hand and swiftly places its mouth over the bottles throat and starts sucking up the liquid. In a blink of an eye, the hopper drank it all away.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
