      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>[OLD]

::You carefully take out this precious drug. For a moment you think about the best approach to feed it to the hopper. You leave it next to the dish, and point at it with your finger. It doesn't take long for hopper to follow your gesture, as it slowly walks up to it. The hopper takes a moment to smell it, before quickly swallowing it.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
