        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">136</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::You carefully fill up the dish with bison milk. The dirty plate somewhat mixes with the nice color of milk, making a greenish mixture in the process.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q69" name="=&gt;q69">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">138</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The hopper cleans up the plate rather quickly, getting bloated in the process. Soon, it starts shaking as it suddenly flops on its side. It gurgles back and forth struggling to catch breath. Vile vomit and rapid sweating ensue, enveloping the entire animal in the mixture of the two. After a while, you can see that the hopper is losing this battle, as it shows very few signs of life. You observe its last ditch efforts before it finally gives up.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a70" name="=&gt;a70">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">140</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
