    <unit id="=&gt;q76" name="=&gt;q76">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">152</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The falling chips produce a quiet yet echoing noise as it bounces around. ::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q77" name="=&gt;q77">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">154</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The hopper hesitates for a moment looking back and forth between you and the chips. It doesn't take long before the hopper eventually goes for it. Upon tasting the chips, the hopper jumps away from the plate, in total confusion. However, after a little while, it would seem that hopper liked it as it goes back finishing what was started.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a78" name="=&gt;a78">
