        <source>::Serve the Juice.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q94" name="=&gt;q94">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">188</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::You carefully serve the Juice onto the dish.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q95" name="=&gt;q95">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">190</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The hopper looks you up and down, before trying the juice out. After its done, it stands still for several seconds, before going back to its previous activity, showing no signs of change.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a96" name="=&gt;a96">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">192</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Back.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a97" name="=&gt;a97">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">194</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q98" name="=&gt;q98">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">196</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Festering meat on the nearby plate is making it quite hard to breathe in this cell. This, coped with your presence, doesn't seem to bother the hopper at all. In the nearby corner, fecal remains further add to this vortex of filth, making this cell stand out way more than the others. Next to the hopper is some broken glass, which is lying in the remains of some halfway evaporated alcohol.::

&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q99" name="=&gt;q99">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">198</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::This hopper is focused on eating the meal from a large cup stuck between the prison cell bars.::

&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q100" name="=&gt;q100">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">200</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Your approach alarms the hopper, as it jumps away from you. It looks around the cell searching for an exit, as it quivers in fear. Soon, it realizes that there's no safe way out and is now facing you directly. Possibly expecting the worst thing to happen, the creature regains some composure; standing still as a rock. Its little eyes, carefully observe your every move.::

&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
